                "text": "This week, the Mikaela Naylon Give Kids a Chance Act passed the House. This landmark bill will accelerate pediatric cancer treatment development and increase access to life-saving treatments \u2014 improving patient outcomes. I am proud to be a cosponsor of this critical legislation, and I hope to see the Senate quickly consider it.",
